ejd1bTZha3Q1QVFlcENJdC1TUEwwZDNkenV2SnQ4b0tvcWM?oc=5","date":"2026-10-02","zh":"塔可鐘 (Taco Bell) 和多鄰國 (Duolingo) 為國家塔可日推出一款新辣醬：味道如下"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-27","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1562088/000162828026012494/duol-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Although education can open the door to economic opportunity, it is also among the principal sources of inequality: the privileged can get the best education in the world, while those with fewer resources, especially in developing countries, may not be able to get even basic schooling. That is why we started Duolingo. We believe that everyone, regardless of how wealthy they are, should have access to high quality education. And today, the technology necessary to enable this is in the hands of billions of people, in the form of a smartphone. At Duolingo, we build products native to the smartphone—bite-sized, on-demand and engaging—to make learning accessible and effective, opening doors for everyone alike.","zh":"儘管教育可以打開經濟機會之門，但它也是不平等的主要根源之一：特權階級可以獲得世界上最好的教育，而資源較少的人，尤其是發展中國家的人，甚至可能無法接受基礎教育。這就是我們創辦 Duolingo 的原因。我們相信每個人，無論多麼富有，都應該獲得高品質的教育。如今，實現這一目標所需的技術以智慧型手機的形式掌握在數十億人的手中。在 Duolingo，我們開發智慧型手機原生的產品——小尺寸、按需且有吸引力——使學習變得容易且有效，為每個人打開大門。"},{"en":"Duolingo is a technology company founded by two engineers, Luis von Ahn and Severin Hacker. Luis and Severin met at Carnegie Mellon University, where Luis was a professor in the Computer Science Department and Severin was his Ph.D. student. Luis, a MacArthur Fellow, grew up in Guatemala and witnessed firsthand the tremendous impact that access to high quality education can have on people's lives. Luis and Severin bonded over the dream of building an intelligent learning system informed by massive amounts of user engagement data that could deliver superior learning outcomes.","zh":"Duolingo 是一家科技公司，由兩位工程師 Luis von Ahn 和 Severin Hacker 創立。路易斯和塞韋林在卡內基美隆大學相識，路易斯是該大學計算機科學系的教授，塞韋林是他的博士學位。學生。路易斯是麥克阿瑟研究員，在瓜地馬拉長大，親眼目睹了接受高品質教育對人們生活的巨大影響。 Luis 和 Severin 的夢想是建立一個智慧學習系統，該系統由大量使用者參與資料提供訊息，可以提供卓越的學習成果。"},{"en":"Our team, which as of December 31, 2025, consisted of more than 900 passionate employees, including more than 430 engineers, aims to build the most sophisticated education platform in the world. We believe that by combining modern technology, the very best talent, and a mission-driven approach, we can create better learning experiences and meaningful improvements in efficacy. Our products are powered by sophisticated data analytics and AI and delivered with world-class art, animation, and design to make it easier for learners to stay motivated, master new material, and achieve their learning goals.","zh":"截至2025年12月31日，我們的團隊由900多位充滿熱情的員工組成，其中包括430多位工程師，旨在打造世界上最先進的教育平台。我們相信，透過結合現代科技、最優秀的人才和使命驅動的方法，我們可以創造更好的學習體驗並有意義地提高效率。我們的產品由先進的數據分析和人工智慧提供支持，並提供世界一流的藝術、動畫和設計，使學習者更容易保持動力、掌握新材料並實現他們的學習目標。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We believe that our relentless focus on building an engaging and effective learning product, powered by our freemium model, has led to a leading market position, as measured by downloads, active users, and brand awareness. However, learners have a variety of options when choosing to learn a language. We compete for learners' time, attention, and share of wallet not only with other online and app-based language learning platforms but also with offline forms of language learning. Because of the extensibility of the Duolingo platform beyond language learning, we also compete with language learning assessment providers, literacy platforms, as well as math, music, and chess learning products.","zh":"我們相信，以下載量、活躍用戶和品牌知名度來衡量，我們堅持不懈地致力於建立有吸引力且有效的學習產品，並在免費增值模式的支持下取得了領先的市場地位。然而，學習者在選擇學習語言時有多種選擇。我們不僅與其他線上和基於應用程式的語言學習平台競爭學習者的時間、注意力和錢包份額，還與線下形式的語言學習競爭。由於 Duolingo 平台的可擴展性超出了語言學習的範圍，我們還與語言學習評估提供者、識字平台以及數學、音樂和國際象棋學習產品競爭。"},{"en":"Our ability to continue to increase our learner base through organic, word-of-mouth and the ongoing engagement provided by our free user experience;","zh":"我們有能力透過有機、口碑和免費用戶體驗提供的持續參與來繼續擴大我們的學習者基礎；"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"License & Service","val":873442000,"zh":"許可與服務"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":164147000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"},{"name":"Advertising","val":79725000,"zh":"廣告"},{"name":"English Test","val":42006000,"zh":"英語測試"},{"name":"IA Ps","val":40479000,"zh":"IA Ps"},{"name":"Product & Service Other Miscellaneous","val":1937000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他雜項"}],"total":1037589000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Non Us","val":645375000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"US","val":392214000,"zh":"美國"}],"total":1037589000}},"peers":["APP","HIMS","MNDY","GTLB","CELH"]}}